{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/1e10cffb1afefcbd7b44cc555d5981ad.avif?t=1759309640\" width=615 height=80 /></span><br><br>Join the fun with Bluey and her family in Bluey: The Videogame! <br><br>Play a brand-new story set across 4 interactive adventures. For the first time ever, explore iconic locations such as the Heeler House, Playgrounds, Creek and a bonus beach location. Play your favourite games from the TV show, including Keepy Uppy, Chattermax Chase, and more!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/fa27c281a67286f23b610af9dd8c5d81.poster.avif?t=1759309640\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/fa27c281a67286f23b610af9dd8c5d81.webm?t=1759309640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/fa27c281a67286f23b610af9dd8c5d81.mp4?t=1759309640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/2af54069589c57b3fb7436d1caae053a.avif?t=1759309640\" width=615 height=80 /></span><br><br>The fun doesn't stop there! This game won't be trifficult, just a lot of fun. Experience the joy and wonder of Bluey's world, with local multiplayer you can play with friends and family in story mode and free play!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/f1e24856defdb93237492e5ebc2567d7.poster.avif?t=1759309640\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/f1e24856defdb93237492e5ebc2567d7.webm?t=1759309640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/f1e24856defdb93237492e5ebc2567d7.mp4?t=1759309640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/d9e563fced6ff8f19a58665022096b4c.avif?t=1759309640\" width=615 height=80 /></span><br><br>Explore and collect items for your sticker book, unlock outfits and uncover the many secrets and hidden references throughout each location. Recreate iconic scenes or create your very own Bluey inspired adventures and games. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/e0b454fa547375f4eda208db8c3e01fa.poster.avif?t=1759309640\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/e0b454fa547375f4eda208db8c3e01fa.webm?t=1759309640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/e0b454fa547375f4eda208db8c3e01fa.mp4?t=1759309640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play time - Play as Bluey and her family including Chilli, Bingo and Bandit.<br><br></li><li>Co-op play - Play with your family and friends in a variety of exciting games and challenges.<br><br></li><li>Explore -  Recreate iconic moments from the TV series and immerse yourself in Bluey\u2019s world</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"It's like a zoo down here!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2078350/5edd219d10e4c7cea1391b616088d4efd9c5de07.jpg"},{"name":"Flamingo Queen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2078350/4431099c85de7a38da90f499ecae1148133a5d78.jpg"},{"name":"Give me squeaky!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2078350/7dc420d9bfddbbe46ab62115b1fc32730462d296.jpg"},{"name":"Freeze!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2078350/1cc0cf9db5971360c77f47eff723240edc0d729f.jpg"},{"name":"Gone With The Wind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2078350/7a23845d8a5eea6695cb278fd8c2825a54797276.jpg"},{"name":"Classic Stripe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2078350/a595c192635eb0f23ee55d73805c1365f3e9f1c9.jpg"},{"name":"Gotcha","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2078350/ec950d973c96c8e4163058e4dc398c0a51c60220.jpg"},{"name":"The Creek is beautiful!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2078350/0f4bc8acc6f3b4119d2e60b3dd5371216171394e.jpg"},{"name":"Family matters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2078350/bf45c6c6439cbdfb72be400b30e5a2a4f2f27d51.jpg"},{"name":"Pretty cool leaves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2078350/656fd01c5e0f4fab6889ca94d02e1d85b04d8207.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2078350?t=1759309640","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759309640","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759309640","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759309640","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Another update. For real life! </h1><p>This means playing with Grandad, Aunt Trixie and Nana. Help them on quests from the Heeler House to the Beach to earn and unlock costumes, toys and more.  Have a more enjoyable experience for little hands, with easier actions to build structures, pick up objects and play games. Keep track of your new trophies and create more memories in your sticker book. <br><br>Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Grandad, Aunt Trixie and Nana. Get ready to help them in new quests.<br></li><li>Leap into a livelier world from the Heeler House to the Beach.<br></li><li>Help your favourite characters in new fetch and craft quests to earn and unlock costumes, toys, and more. <br></li><li>A more enjoyable experience for little hands, with easier actions to build structures, pick up objects and play games.<br></li><li>Keep track of your new trophies and see what it\u2019s like to freeze Grandad. Create more memories in your sticker book.</li></ul></p><br><h1>Hey, Bluey fans! Muffin and Uncle Stripe want to get in on the fun. Explore, laugh, and celebrate with them in this new addition.</h1><p>This update includes:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>New characters added to the selection line-up. Play as Muffin and Uncle Stripe.<br></li><li>Search for special character-related collectibles. Find all the colourful flamingos with Muffin and help squash-obsessed Uncle Stripe collect the rackets.<br></li><li>Unlock new pictures to add to the upgraded look to add your colourful sticker book.<br></li><li>Exchanging stars and medals to earn a special reward for discovering all the unlockables in a set.</li></ul><br>The new updates mean players can explore more of Bluey\u2019s world playing with more of the Heeler family. Be as energetic as Muffin, collecting flamingos from the Playground to the Creek. Or choose to be the fun, squash-obsessed Uncle Stripe, collecting rackets. See what special reward you\u2019ll earn in exchange for stars and medals.<br></p><br><h1>Hey, Bluey fans! We\u2019ve got a new free update for you!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to the valuable feedback from our players, we\u2019ve improved user experience with tons of fixes and optimisations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New additions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy classic games with new rules. Keepy Uppy, Magic Xylophone, Chattermax Chase, and Ground is Lava now have 5 stars to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game is set in its own unique fun new location</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the new Games Book to quickly travel to each new game location</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New rules! New objects! New interactions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Bluey\u2019s world with new items to unlock and keep your eyes open for more updates coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/1e10cffb1afefcbd7b44cc555d5981ad.avif?t=1759309640\" width=615 height=80 /></span><br><br>Join the fun with Bluey and her family in Bluey: The Videogame! <br><br>Play a brand-new story set across 4 interactive adventures. For the first time ever, explore iconic locations such as the Heeler House, Playgrounds, Creek and a bonus beach location. Play your favourite games from the TV show, including Keepy Uppy, Chattermax Chase, and more!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/fa27c281a67286f23b610af9dd8c5d81.poster.avif?t=1759309640\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/fa27c281a67286f23b610af9dd8c5d81.webm?t=1759309640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/fa27c281a67286f23b610af9dd8c5d81.mp4?t=1759309640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/2af54069589c57b3fb7436d1caae053a.avif?t=1759309640\" width=615 height=80 /></span><br><br>The fun doesn't stop there! This game won't be trifficult, just a lot of fun. Experience the joy and wonder of Bluey's world, with local multiplayer you can play with friends and family in story mode and free play!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/f1e24856defdb93237492e5ebc2567d7.poster.avif?t=1759309640\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/f1e24856defdb93237492e5ebc2567d7.webm?t=1759309640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/f1e24856defdb93237492e5ebc2567d7.mp4?t=1759309640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/d9e563fced6ff8f19a58665022096b4c.avif?t=1759309640\" width=615 height=80 /></span><br><br>Explore and collect items for your sticker book, unlock outfits and uncover the many secrets and hidden references throughout each location. Recreate iconic scenes or create your very own Bluey inspired adventures and games. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/e0b454fa547375f4eda208db8c3e01fa.poster.avif?t=1759309640\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/e0b454fa547375f4eda208db8c3e01fa.webm?t=1759309640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/extras/e0b454fa547375f4eda208db8c3e01fa.mp4?t=1759309640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play time - Play as Bluey and her family including Chilli, Bingo and Bandit.<br><br></li><li>Co-op play - Play with your family and friends in a variety of exciting games and challenges.<br><br></li><li>Explore -  Recreate iconic moments from the TV series and immerse yourself in Bluey\u2019s world</li></ul>","developers":["Artax Games.","Casual Brothers Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078350/e4b5bd9e15e6fb7f1242e9897e01da3da8332d92/header.jpg?t=1759309640","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"BLUEY (word mark and character logos) are trade marks of Ludo Studio Pty Limited and are used under license. BLUEY logo \u00a9 Ludo Studio Pty Limited 2018. Licensed by BBC Studios. BBC is a trade mark of the British Broadcasting Corporation and is used under license. BBC logo \u00a9BBC 1996. Published by Outright Games Limited. Software \u00a92023 Outright Games Limited. \u00a92023 Artax Games. \u00a92025 Casual Brothers Ltd. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/